# The deliverable of this repository is a byte-exact Internet-Draft text and a
# content-hashed conformance manifest. A working tree whose bytes differ from
# the committed bytes cannot be checked against either, so the working tree is
# pinned to LF on every platform rather than left to each clone's
# core.autocrlf. Without this, a Windows clone with the default
# core.autocrlf=true rewrites every text file on checkout and
# conformance/runners/verify_manifest.py reports every digest in the manifest
# as a mismatch on a tree that is in fact correct.
* text=auto eol=lf
